    <span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Rentals</span>
    <h1>Hanoi Motorbike Rental: Couples Rental Paperwork Questions</h1>
    <p>Paperwork is the part of a rental that couples can do better than anyone else and most often do worse than anyone expects. Two people can split the reading, remember twice as much and keep each other honest at the counter, and yet the classic failure mode of a couple's rental is the silent delegation, one partner nods along while the other signs, and nobody can later say what was actually agreed. The fix is a shared question list, agreed in advance and asked out loud. This guide is that list.</p>
    <p>The page is part of the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> cluster, written for couples. The verified prices for the whole fleet are on the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">cost hub</a>, the general question bank is on the <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a> page, and the bike-choice conversation that comes before the paperwork is covered in the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/couples-bike-choice/">couples bike choice guide</a>.</p>

    <nav class="toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
      <p>On this page</p>
      <ol>
        <li><a href="#sec-1">The couple's paperwork advantage</a></li>
        <li><a href="#sec-2">The rental agreement: read it together</a></li>
        <li><a href="#sec-3">ID and passport questions for two</a></li>
        <li><a href="#sec-4">Deposit and payment questions</a></li>
        <li><a href="#sec-5">Liability and insurance questions</a></li>
